    "body": "This issue appears off-topic for this repository because it is either an API implementation bug (which should be filed in the [Chromium Issue Tracker](https://issues.chromium.org/) or an issue with the device.\r\n\r\nFor these kinds of USB communication issues I recommend using a tool like [Wireshark](https://www.wireshark.org/) to capture the USB traffic. This will show you the low-level communication between the host and device and may make the issue clearer. For example, if the host driver is not requesting data regularly or if the device is pausing unusually before responding to the request.\r\n\r\nYour code looks generally reasonable though a bit out-of-order since it calls `write()` before `getWriter()`. I assume that is a copy-paste error.",
